  "description": {
    "text": "In 2018 McDonald's handed out different cards in different countries for the first time. In the United States, from 16 October to 12 November 2018, each Happy Meal held one of these 12 cards and a figure of a Legendary Pokémon: Latios, Latias, Dialga, Palkia, Zekrom, Reshiram, Tornadus or Thundurus. Pokémon said their foil could only be found in McDonald's Happy Meals. France had a larger set of its own that summer, McDonald's Collection 2018 (French).",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "PocketMonsters.net: McDonald's Happy Meal - October 2018",
        "url": "https://pocketmonsters.net/news/3378"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Pikachu (4/12, McDonald's 2018)",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/card/pikachu-4-12-mcdonalds-mcdonalds-collection/"
      }
    ]
  },
